title: NoOptionStart
---
<<declare $has_key = false>>
<<declare $has_sword = false>>
<<declare $has_map = false>>

You find yourself in a small room with three pedestals.
<<jump ChooseItem>>
===

title: ChooseItem
---
Each pedestal holds an item. What do you take?
-> Take the rusty key <<if not $has_key>>
    You pick up the key. It's old but might open something.
    <<set $has_key = true>>
-> Take the wooden sword <<if not $has_sword>>
    You grab the sword. It's not much, but it's something.
    <<set $has_sword = true>>
-> Take the torn map <<if not $has_map>>
    You carefully fold the map and pocket it.
    <<set $has_map = true>>

You look around the room again.
<<if $has_key && $has_sword && $has_map>>
    With all items collected, you head for the door.
<<else>>
    <<jump ChooseItem>>
<<endif>>
===
